 within our  within our communities  and that is why we've taken the position  that we have and  i i am absolutely confident that we've  done the right thing  and if you do enter tier three will you  consider your position  well i would always i always consider  what i've done and whether it was the  the right thing to have done but i think  i've just said to you  at no point do i think i've i've acted  in the wrong way here people say  posturing well  it isn't posturing to represent the  people who have least in society that in  my view is what politics  should be about and actually what  politics has kind of forgotten about  in in recent times who in western speaks  up for people driving taxis  who down there speaks up for people  working in pubs or in bookies they they  don't  largely so politics is in the end of the  day about representation  giving people a voice and i believe i've  done that  uh it's up to other people here to judge  whether i've done the right thing or the  wrong thing  but uh i am as i say in my own mind uh  i i feel i've done what what i should do  in the role that i hold

